{"name":"HeightFog","kind":"component","module":"render","doc":"Exponential height fog lit by the sun, the sky and local lights (volumetric shafts where shadows cut the beams). Density halves every <code>falloff × ln 2</code> metres above <code>baseHeight</code>. The first entity in ID order wins.","fields":[{"name":"density","typeHtml":"f32","doc":"Extinction at <code>baseHeight</code>, per metre. 0.002 is a light haze (visibility ≈ 1.5 km), 0.02 a thick fog (≈ 150 m).","default":"0.002","range":"0 – 0.1"},{"name":"baseHeight","typeHtml":"f32","doc":"World altitude where the fog has its full density.","default":"0","unit":"m"},{"name":"falloff","typeHtml":"f32","doc":"Scale height: density falls by a factor of e over this many metres of altitude.","default":"60","unit":"m","range":"1 – 10000"},{"name":"albedo","typeHtml":"color","doc":"Scattering colour (single-scattering albedo, linear). Grey-white for water fog, warm for dust.","default":"[0.9,0.9,0.9,1]"},{"name":"anisotropy","typeHtml":"f32","doc":"Forward-scattering bias: 0 is uniform, toward 1 the fog glows around the sun and lamps.","default":"0.3","range":"0 – 0.9"}],"variants":[],"usedBy":{"types":[],"commands":[]},"usage":[{"label":"Add it","html":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">ara </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">do</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> component.add </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">p entity</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">name:Crate </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">p component</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">HeightFog </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">--</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">why </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-string)\">\"Add HeightFog\"</span></span></code></pre>"},{"label":"Set a field","html":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">ara </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">do</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> property.set </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">p entity</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">name:Crate </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">p path</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">HeightFog.density </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">p value</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-number)\">0.004</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> --</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">why </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-string)\">\"Tune HeightFog\"</span></span></code></pre>"},{"label":"In a scene document","html":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-property)\">  \"HeightFog\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-property)\">    \"density\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">: </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-number)\">0.004</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">}</span></span></code></pre>"},{"label":"From C#","html":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">ref</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> var</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> heightfog </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-function)\"> Get</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-type)\">HeightFog</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">>();</span></span></code></pre>"}],"csharp":"HeightFog"}
